{"server":"cn","storyId":"act30side_level_act30side_01_beg","groupId":"act30side","stageId":"act30side_01","title":"注意事项","storyCode":"RS-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"394845304779060f26b1c20cca6a023c7432ad0e56ddf6370d2434ac530c64ab","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"烈夏与子爵结伴而行，共同登上开往银心湖的列车；接到列车可能有古怪的线报，间谍“灰礼帽”登车观察；锏则为了找人跳上列车。好戏开场。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"身手矫健的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬！哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气喘吁吁的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精疲力尽的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......！嚯啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斗志昂扬的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"吃我一招！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众山雪鬼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊——！冲啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"你们都没吃饭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"再来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精疲力尽的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，不、不行了，真的不行了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是怎么教你们的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站起来，抓紧你们手里的武器！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斗志昂扬的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气喘吁吁的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......嗬啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"速度太慢。力道不足。法术太仓促。战术太死板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就有些默契罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总体还是太弱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"身手矫健的山雪鬼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那哪能和老大比......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精疲力尽的山雪鬼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精疲力尽的山雪鬼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能让老大夸一句，这段时间的训练也算值得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斗志昂扬的山雪鬼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还不够！迟早有一天，我也要像老大那样，能单手切碎山石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气喘吁吁的山雪鬼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就凭你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你们休息够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就再来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众山雪鬼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"老大！不好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生了什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，大事，出大事了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"山下那边忽然见血了......我们都应付不来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"十万火急！老大你快去看看吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇！开车了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈！妈妈快来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——哇！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急躁的母亲","speakerId":"avg_npc_281_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都告诉你别在车上跑这么快了！伤到哪里没有？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈，你看，是戴奇怪帽子的外国人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急躁的母亲","speakerId":"avg_npc_281_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么说话呢！不许拿手指着别人，圣女大人不喜欢不礼貌的孩子，还不快道歉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急躁的母亲","speakerId":"avg_npc_281_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，这位先生，真是对不起啊，孩子不懂事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借过一下。前面是我的位子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（车厢内的总人数明显超过定员。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（当地平民和观光客的人数基本持平，唔，作为观光列车，这倒是少见。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（最后排靠墙角堆放的麻袋有点古怪......麻袋内有异动，是违规携带的活物？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔，没有其他异常，也没有值得在意的人物......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（情报只指向开往银心湖的列车，实际线索果然没有那么好找。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（还是得找个机会去包厢检查一下......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咚咚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"从刚刚起，椅背后方就一直传来异动。\n谢拉格的列车上，难道有什么专门踢人椅背的怪兽吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咚咚咚咚咚。\n像是对他的无反应感到不满，椅背又被连环踢了好几下。\n片刻之后，坐在后排的孩子探出头来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怪帽子叔叔，怪帽子叔叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔，你是不是特别喜欢坐车呀，前两天我也看到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你见过我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"见过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔，你是不是之前没见过铁轨和火车，所以才特别喜欢坐车啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔你怎么还咳嗽了呀？别害羞，我不会笑话你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们这的火车可好可厉害了，我也好喜欢啊！我妈说，都是圣女大人和恩希欧迪斯老爷厉害，是耶拉冈德保佑我们呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不如......我把我的小火车玩具借给你，我们一起玩开火车游戏吧，叔叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急躁的母亲","speakerId":"avg_npc_281_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩什么玩具！你乖乖回来坐好，别去烦人家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急躁的母亲","speakerId":"avg_npc_281_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实在不好意思啊，先生，打扰你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急躁的母亲","speakerId":"avg_npc_281_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这孩子就是欠教训，我一定好好管教他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这顶帽子......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪帽子外国佬","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看起来很奇怪吗？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的乘客可真不少，新建成的耶拉冈德像看来确实是很受欢迎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次上车我都觉得，卡西米尔骑士竞技的比赛现场——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟！有什么东西在攻击我的脚趾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......羽兽？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的羽兽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（用力啄咬）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎、哎哎哎，羽兽兄，高抬贵“首”......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就这么把它给放了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题吗？我怎么记得车上好像说是不给带宠物的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"规矩是这么定的，不过呢，有的时候不会查得太严，也算是给有需要的老乡们行个方便嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，这种羽兽一般都会用麻袋装着，不会出太大问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不说这些。来吧，女士，我订的包厢就在前面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g3_traincarriage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"挤死我了，终于又能坐下来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到这趟车的坐票这么难买，这次真是多谢你帮忙，大叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"举手之劳，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对我不用这么客气，也别女士女士的了，叫我罗莎琳就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么恭敬不如从命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“罗莎琳”，这是一个很适合你的名字。非常动听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，好听吧，是我妈取的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔你叫什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以称呼我为哈洛德。当然，继续叫“大叔”也没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的运气不错，罗莎琳。如果错过这班车，恐怕就很难在天黑之前抵达银心湖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，幸好最后还是赶上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈洛德也是要去银心湖吧？你是要去干嘛来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我已经回答过这个问题了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢拉格的风光如此壮美，我当然是要去一饱眼福的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不会被骗到，你们这一大群人，看起来一点都不像是来观光的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们看着不像观光客吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不太像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，更像是来找茬的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，哈哈，找茬？绝无此事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是已经被谢拉格的风景人文迷得神魂颠倒，甚至开始考虑退休之后要不要干脆来这里养老了呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯，只要不出大问题，我们当然就可以是观光客......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那要是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——那你呢，罗莎琳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在游客里，你的谢拉格语算是说得很不错了，这是你头一次来谢拉格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这话题转移得也太生硬了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。我没有说过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我勉强算是半个谢拉格人吧，虽然我自己完全没什么感觉啦，我是跟着我妈在乌萨斯长大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，令堂是乌萨斯人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。不过我妈告诉我说，我是在谢拉格出生的，我爹是个谢拉格人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小时候的事我记不太清了，要说是旅行的话，也算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说来，从见面起我就一直想问......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳，你一直抱在怀里的盒子是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，如果有冒犯到你的个人隐私，你可以什么都不用说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事。也没什么不好说的，我只是在想该怎么说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我妈托付给我的......遗物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请容许我表达哀悼之情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉提及你的伤心之事，罗莎琳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"节哀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，我有什么好伤心的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这次回来，就是为了完成我妈的心愿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g7_thoroughfare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赶驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏小姐，这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经没事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该解决的，我都解决了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赶驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏了您......锏小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赶驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然谁知道会变成什么样，耶拉冈德在上，都是活生生的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能做到这一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。场面......不太好看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赶驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，现在也只能这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，你身上的血迹要不要处理一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等会再说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间紧急，虽然我处理过，但难保后续不会再出问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在最要紧的是找到“那个人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"可是老大，我们接到消息，对方现在已经离开车站了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"如果现在去联系铁路的人停车，恐怕会引起恐慌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停车？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"那还能怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看下面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"列车马上就要通过下面的山道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山雪鬼","speakerId":"avg_npc_275","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，老、老大？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她落下的身姿似比雪还要轻，又像比石更重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人会在哪？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
